libgccjit: GCC trunk's jit changes since GCC 16

Upstream gcc-mirror/gcc commits 85a58be7b6 8307743868 88a676869a
3eb88989cf 32cd422ee5 d45e81a30a 123b6a2397, the jit part of
2f5ed17008, and 54df3a3d98 (attribute handlers shared with c-family;
c-attribs.cc's declarations of handle_callback_only_attribute, which
16.2 lacks, left out).  The base the rust-lang fork is built on.

